    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />As for shortest wavelengths,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></math>.&nbsp;<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />N